This <University of Oxford> Part B paper is cross-listed for Mathematics and Mathematics and Statistics. Section A concerns <mathematical biology>, and section B concerns <dynamical systems>. https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/maths_past_papers_3[Source release]{ref} The archive contains the complete editable eight-page transcription. Bounded searches of official sources found no advertised answers to this exact paper. The original solutions cover every source leaf and every unnumbered task in questions 5–8.

